{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 93922, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 66333, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "12.9新角评价", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1638967281, "updated_at": 1640024289, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1640024289, "last_at": 1676503680, "comment_count": 53, "status": 1, "summary": "感谢二狗姐姐帮忙优化排版@二狗新角评价更新一览：1.增加了技能icon，以后再也不用担心文字游戏了，各种充能加速，冲不冲突，一眼就看得出，个人认为技能图标是对于加深游戏理解很重要的一环，这也是我做新版", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967383215_76954082.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 32, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 15991, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 93922, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967573499_38557027.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967573499_38557027.png\" style=\"width: 69px; height: 60px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">感谢二狗姐姐帮忙优化排版@二狗</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967543706_92947374.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967543706_92947374.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967383215_76954082.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967383215_76954082.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(171, 8, 8);\">新角评价更新一览：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(161, 18, 196);\">增加了技能icon</span>，以后再也不用担心文字游戏了，各种充能加速，冲不冲突，一眼就看得出，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">个人认为技能图标是对于加深游戏理解很重要的一环，这也是我做新版的目的之一。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(161, 18, 196);\">增加了每个点火星级的具体提升</span>，新角色应该点几红也是一览无余，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">旧版的表格我想了很久，没办法做出这种效果来，只能采取新版</span>（改版第二原因）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3.<span style=\"color: rgb(161, 18, 196);\">由偏方形的表格变为长条形的竖向排版。</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">更方便手机阅读</span>，旧版表格是方正的矩形，用手机看可能不方便放大看，然后字又比较小，所以做了长条形的竖版，在手机上看的更清楚，电脑上看着也没问题。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">（改版第三原因）</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">新增了对策点火石推荐</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">，以后不用再问对策带什么石头了。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(154, 3, 3);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(154, 3, 3);\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(154, 3, 3);\">新版新角评价意见收集：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">1.<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">字体是灰色的可能有点暗</span>，依然会有看不清的隐患，下一版考虑加深字体颜色（黑色）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">希望大家踊跃提出意见，我尽量修改。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(200, 0, 0);\">题外话：</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 最近wiki风气很差，之前兔姐发过公告禁止讨论脚本相关事宜，希望各位自觉遵守，开脚本的别跳脸，开脚本不是什么光明磊落的事。<span style=\"color: rgb(196, 2, 2);\">所以，以后相关内容都会进行删帖处理。</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 之前Wiki的好友发车表都被举报封掉了（因为脚本太多影响新玩家正常加好友打Raid了，史莱姆被秒），所以我将发车表取消了，<span style=\"color: rgb(200, 0, 0);\">保证新人体验是Wiki的首要任务。</span>各位还是自己找好友加吧。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">&nbsp; 给新人的建议：加好友尽量避开MY、AY各种神秘组织代码，后续我会想办法给新玩家一个互帮互助的平台，不受各种脚本玩家影响。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; Wiki还是偏向新人的一个交流平台，大家不要把游戏的灰色地带带到这里来，自己心里懂就行了。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(196, 2, 2);\">还有一件事</span>，游戏不顺心来Wiki吐槽是很正常的一件事，谁还没有黑到底的一期呢？大家友好交流不要吵架，如果你觉得他说的对，就帮他顶帖，觉得他说的不对，笑笑就好不必回帖。对喷更是没必要，两边玩着都不舒服，友好交流，有这对喷的时间不如多凹2层RB。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 对了，最后一个消息，预计在1-2月，我有想法在哔哩哔哩开直播玩玩<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">（暂时的想法）</span>，到时候萌新可以来直播间问问题，我一边玩游戏，一边做攻略，一边解答问题，经典三线程操作。<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">最近老铁也在B站直播，各位可以关注LaoTie101，不定时开播。</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638967383215_76954082.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_co